{"id":5070,"date":"2018-11-01T19:27:10","date_gmt":"2018-11-01T23:27:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=5070"},"modified":"2018-11-01T19:27:10","modified_gmt":"2018-11-01T23:27:10","slug":"our-stop-at-the-home-of-the-aliens","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2018\/11\/01\/our-stop-at-the-home-of-the-aliens\/","title":{"rendered":"Our Stop at The Home of The Aliens"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><em>November 1st, 2018<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>Roswell, New Mexico<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>We were through this area a couple years ago and stayed at the Escapees &#8220;North Ranch&#8221; RV Park at Lakewood, NM and took the opportunity to visit Carlsbad Caverns, but our schedule at that time didn&#8217;t allow for a trip to Roswell.<\/p>\n<p>So this time (after ABQ Balloon Fiesta and RV rallies at Wellington and Brownwood, TX) we decided to take in Roswell and it&#8217;s surroundings for a couple of days.<\/p>\n<p>We &#8220;dry camped&#8221; just about 12 miles due east of Roswell at Bottomless Lakes State Park.\u00a0 Dry camping means there are no hook-ups for electricity or water (fresh or waste).\u00a0 We bring along our own electricity and water so dry camping for a week or so is not a problem for us.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5072\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5072\" style=\"width: 300px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_143545.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-5072\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_143545-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_143545-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_143545-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_143545-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_143545.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5072\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Our (1st) Dry Camping Spot at Bottomless Lakes State Park<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>When we pulled in and reviewed the sites available, we decided to camp at &#8220;The Devil&#8217;s Inkwell&#8221;.\u00a0 We backed the coach into a nice wide spot where we could take a walk up the hill and look down into the &#8220;inkwell&#8221; and over our site to the western setting sun.\u00a0 A beautiful and quiet spot.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5073\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5073\" style=\"width: 8359px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_181638.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5073 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_181638.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"8359\" height=\"1914\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_181638.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_181638-300x69.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_181638-768x176.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_181638-1024x234.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 8359px) 100vw, 8359px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5073\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Panoramic view of Devils Inkwell and our dry camp spot down below<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>The &#8220;Bottomless Lakes&#8221; are really giant sinkholes.\u00a0 There are a number of them in the park ranging from 17&#8242; to about 90&#8242; deep.\u00a0 The water is crystal clear and while some of the water is great for aquatic life, some of the other lakes are too high in saline (salt water) for anything to live there.<\/p>\n<p>After our first night there, we moved our rig from Devil&#8217;s Inkwell over to Lea Lake Day Use area.\u00a0 This gave us a great view of the lake and although there were other campers in the area, no one was closer than a couple hundred feet.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5075\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5075\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_094328.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5075 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_094328.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_094328.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_094328-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_094328-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_094328-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5075\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Here&#8217;s our spot right at the edge of Lea Lake<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5076\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5076\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_125429.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5076 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_125429.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_125429.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_125429-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_125429-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_125429-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5076\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">This is a view from the park road up atop the lake. Our rig is on the right side of the picture at about the 2 o&#8217;clock position<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/LV6b14wAVKg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>And of course, who could visit the Roswell area without trying to connect with an alien or two?<\/p>\n<figure style=\"width: 2592px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_110849.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5080 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_110849.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2592\" height=\"1458\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_110849.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_110849-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_110849-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181030_110849-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2592px) 100vw, 2592px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">These guys welcomed us as we drove into town.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5079\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5079\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_153355.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5079 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_153355.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_153355.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_153355-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_153355-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_153355-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5079\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Part of a display the the UFO Museum in town<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5078\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5078\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_153201.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5078 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_153201.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_153201.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_153201-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_153201-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_153201-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5078\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Spooky &#8211; Their eyes followed us wherever we went<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5077\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5077\" style=\"width: 2592px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_151431.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5077 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_151431.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2592\" height=\"1458\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_151431.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_151431-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_151431-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181029_151431-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2592px) 100vw, 2592px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5077\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Visiting the International UFO Museum<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>We ended our 2nd evening with a &#8220;night out&#8221; to the Cattle Baron Restaurant.\u00a0 We split a Teriyaki Kabob and each enjoyed their salad bar.\u00a0 What a great meal!<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5083\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5083\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Cattle-Baron-Salad.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5083 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Cattle-Baron-Salad.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Cattle-Baron-Salad.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Cattle-Baron-Salad-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Cattle-Baron-Salad-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Cattle-Baron-Salad-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5083\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">My FIRST trip to the salad bar! &#8211; Not good for my &#8220;Low Carb&#8221; diet but you just gotta splurge sometimes!<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>We could&#8217;ve just driven on westward toward our final destination, but being this close we figured we just had to stop and see the sights at Roswell.\u00a0 It was worth the time to see not just the alien novelties, but the park was beautiful and restful.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>November 1st, 2018 Roswell, New Mexico We were through this area a couple years ago and stayed at the Escapees &#8220;North Ranch&#8221; RV Park at Lakewood, NM and took the opportunity to visit Carlsbad Caverns, but our schedule at that time didn&#8217;t allow for a trip to Roswell. So this time (after ABQ Balloon Fiesta &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2018\/11\/01\/our-stop-at-the-home-of-the-aliens\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Our Stop at The Home of The Aliens<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,586,19546,554707329],"tags":[554707282,554707610,554707232,554707555,554707494,554707319,554707612,554707318,3559,554707611,554707613,554707615,554707614],"class_list":["post-5070","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-food","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-aliens","tag-bottomless-lakes","tag-camping","tag-dry-camping","tag-motorhome","tag-new-mexico","tag-park-ranger","tag-roswell","tag-rv","tag-sinkholes","tag-steak-house","tag-tent-camping","tag-ufo"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5070","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5070"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5070\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5085,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5070\/revisions\/5085"}],"wp:attachme